   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "Note"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "H3 CLIP PLAN - ASSEMBLY, FREE MODE\n\n1. Pick the same plan in the nodes (example: robot_workshop.plan.json).\n2. Run: each saved clip is decoded (picture and sound) and the joins are made at the same points for picture and sound. On a 'continue' clip the sound of the join is the new clip's (it extends the previous one without a jump); after a hard cut, the second and a half of hidden lead-in is replaced by the end of the previous clip, like the picture.\n\nlast_clip = 0 assembles the whole plan; another value assembles only clips 1 to N.\nAny background music is added afterwards, in editing.\n\nTAKE SELECTION (node on the right): every generation of a clip is a take. Click a take to play its preview, 'use this take' to choose it. The choice is saved in the project (selection.json) and is used by the assembly and by the following 'continue' clips. Choosing a take of a 'continue' clip also chooses the take of the previous clip it is built on. 'delete unchosen takes' cleans up."
   ],
